mpa\u00f1a Huasteca", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=00U797MtT1U", "captured_at": "2025-10-25", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2025_10_25_carolina_viggiano_partido_apendice_del_gobierno", "label": "El partido como ap\u00e9ndice del gobierno", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "grafo/corpus/episodios/2025-10-25_carolina-viggiano.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=00U797MtT1U", "captured_at": "2025-10-25", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Seg\u00fan Viggiano, el gobernador decid\u00eda todas las candidaturas y el PRI s\u00f3lo las operaba; no era partido que debatiera."}, {"id": "2025_10_25_carolina_viggiano_traicion_desde_el_poder", "label": "Traici\u00f3n desde el poder (hacer perder al candidato propio)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "grafo/corpus/episodios/2025-10-25_carolina-viggiano.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=00U797MtT1U", "captured_at": "2025-10-25", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dirigentes que apoyaban candidatos de otro partido cuando el propio no era de su simpat\u00eda; fragment\u00f3 la Huasteca y la regi\u00f3n de Huichapan."}, {"id": "2025_10_25_carolina_viggiano_indicacion_no_votar", "label": "Indicaci\u00f3n de no votar bajo el gobierno de Omar Fayad", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "grafo/corpus/episodios/2025-10-25_carolina-viggiano.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=00U797MtT1U", "captured_at": "2025-10-25", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Los conductores relatan que el gobierno de Fayad orden\u00f3 bajar la votaci\u00f3n en Hidalgo."}, {"id": "2025_10_25_carolina_viggiano_falta_relevo_generacional", "label": "Falta de relevo generacional en el PRI", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "grafo/corpus/episodios/2025-10-25_carolina-viggiano.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=00U797MtT1U", "captured_at": "2025-10-25", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fayad no form\u00f3 cuadros y Osorio se llev\u00f3 a los suyos, dejando un vac\u00edo."}, {"id": "2025_10_25_carolina_viggiano_corrupcion_gobierno_fayad", "label": "Corrupci\u00f3n y decadencia del gobierno de Omar Fayad", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "grafo/corpus/episodios/2025-10-25_carolina-viggiano.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=00U797MtT1U", "captured_at": "2025-10-25", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2025_10_25_carolina_viggiano_primera_minoria_senado", "label": "Primera minor\u00eda al Senado", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "grafo/corpus/episodios/2025-10-25_carolina-viggiano.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=00U797MtT1U", "captured_at": "2025-10-25", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Viggiano afirma que Fayad y Osorio quer\u00edan que perdiera y cada uno mand\u00f3 a su candidata."}, {"id": "2025_10_25_carolina_viggiano_desaparicion_fonden", "label": "Desaparici\u00f3n del FONDEN y desv\u00edo al Tren Maya", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "grafo/corpus/episodios/2025-10-25_carolina-viggiano.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=00U797MtT1U", "captured_at": "2025-10-25", "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "2025_10_25_carolina_viggiano", "label": "2025-10-25_carolina-viggiano", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "grafo/corpus/episodios/2025-10-25_carolina-viggiano.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "6,152 vistas"}], "edges": [{"source": "2025_10_30_jose_antonio_rojo_episodio", "target": "2025_10_25_carolina_viggiano_los_hdp", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "grafo/corpus/episodios/2025-10-25_carolina-vi